(*---
description: Checks if_formula on the cycle machine under weak fairness.
ref: tlc2/tool/liveness/LiveCheck.java; tlc2/tool/liveness/Liveness.java
features:
  - liveness
outcome: any
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE live_cycle__weak__if_formula ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == x' = (x + 1) % 3
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x /\ WF_x(Next)
Prop == IF TRUE THEN <>(x = 1) ELSE <>(x = 2)
====

